<h1>Content</h1>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">Use <code>content_for</code> with these yield names to inject content into the layout. All yield names are prefixed with <code>l_ui_</code> to avoid collisions with your application.</p>

<div class="l-ui-container--table l-ui-utility--mt-lg">
  <table class="l-ui-table">
    <thead class="l-ui-table__header">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell">Yield name</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell">Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="l-ui-table__body">
      <tr>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell--primary"><code>:l_ui_navigation_items</code></td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Sidebar navigation links. Use with the <code>l_ui_navigation_item</code> helper.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell--primary"><code>:l_ui_panel_heading</code></td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Content for the panel header area.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell--primary"><code>:l_ui_panel_body</code></td>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Content for the panel body. The panel is only rendered when this block is present.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Navigation items</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">Populate the sidebar navigation using the <code>:l_ui_navigation_items</code> yield and the <code>l_ui_navigation_item</code> helper.</p>

<div class="l-ui-utility--mt-xl" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button--outline" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View Code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3>Navigation items</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close">
        <svg class="l-ui-icon--sm" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <code class="l-ui-surface">&lt;% content_for :l_ui_navigation_items do %&gt;
  &lt;%= l_ui_navigation_item "Dashboard", dashboard_path %&gt;
  &lt;%= l_ui_navigation_item "Settings", settings_path %&gt;
  &lt;%= l_ui_navigation_item "Users", users_path %&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;

&lt;%= render template: "layouts/layered_ui/application" %&gt;</code>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Panel</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">The slide-out panel is only rendered when the <code>:l_ui_panel_body</code> content block is present. Click the panel button in the bottom right corner to see it in action, or use <kbd>⌘I</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+I</kbd> to toggle it.</p>

<div class="l-ui-utility--mt-xl" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button--outline" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View Code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3>Panel</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close">
        <svg class="l-ui-icon--sm" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <code class="l-ui-surface">&lt;% content_for :l_ui_panel_heading do %&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;Activity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;

&lt;% content_for :l_ui_panel_body do %&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;User signed up&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Order placed&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;</code>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>
